      "doctor_question": "Have you ever had another period in your life where you felt this energized and needed very little sleep, or is this the first time?",
      "targeted_symptom": "manic_episode_duration",
      "patient_response": "Well, I mean, it's not the first time. I've had these... stretches, I guess you'd call them. Where I'm just totally wired, full of energy, barely sleeping, and I've got all these big plans going on. It's been happening off and on for, I don't know, about 11 months now? \n\nIt actually started right around the time I decided I was going to build that deck in the backyard. I bought all this treated lumber, stacked it up by the fence. It's still out there, actually. You know, you really have to watch out for termites with that wood if it sits too long. My neighbor, Mr. Henderson, he had termites get into his garage a couple years ago. They had to tent the whole thing, big red and yellow striped tent, looked like a circus was in town. He was so mad because he had to move his vintage Corvette out into the driveway for three days. Beautiful car, cherry red, 1969. I always wanted a classic car, maybe a Mustang. But anyway, yeah, these energized periods, they've been coming and going for almost a year now.",
